Patch summary:
Backport drm_hwcomposer's upstream stale-MST-pipeline teardown
(a0c304a8ff) onto the pinned Android 16 QPR2 base so hotplug refresh cannot
leave a removed connector holding a CRTC needed by its replacement. Also carry
the applicable upstream C++23 direct <vector> include (a7abcb9458); the same
direct include is added to DrmDevice because this backport changes its public
return type. Newer Android 17 planner/backlight fixes are intentionally omitted
because those subsystems do not exist on this base.

